I don't know if someone came up with this, but as such lists are generally  
good meme, it would be fun to create it.  The rules should cover general  
ideas for survival, but don't have to be limited to this.  I hope, the  
discussion would be fruitful.  My six proposals (random order) with short  
explanations, what they cover.

- NH is not Quake (I know it's not mine, can't remember which spoiler  
featured it)
	think before you move
	haste - make waste
	don't use brute force
- Don't overburden yourself
	stash often
	don't be greedy
- Use all the game features
	use ctrl-move, diagonals, don't lean on keys
- Melee is rarely optimal
	use ranged weapons and polearms
	train the pet
- Don't be embarased to be weak
	escape often
	use E-word
- Be prepared
	complete ascension kit quickly
	assume the worst

Any other ideas?  I hope you'll be interested and we create this.
